<title>USA: Millicom ups stake in its Paraguay unit.</title>
<headline>Millicom ups stake in its Paraguay unit.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Millicom International Cellular SA said it acquired 12.0 percent of Telefonica Celular del Paraguay SA (Telecel), Millicom's Paraguayan subsidiary, from a local partner, thereby increasing its ownership in Telecel to 96 percent from 84 percent.</p>
<p>Millicom developes and operates cellular telephone systems world-wide with operations in Asia, Latin America, Europe and Africa.</p>
